@startuml
!include _dfd-style.iuml

title DFD Level 2 - Process 3.0 Search Donors

rectangle "Blood Seeker" as Seeker

usecase "3.1\nFind Compatible\nGroups" as P31
usecase "3.2\nFetch Donors\nby Group" as P32
usecase "3.3\nFilter\nby City" as P33
usecase "3.4\nCheck\nReadiness" as P34
usecase "3.5\nSort\nResults" as P35

database "D1  Donors" as D1
database "D2  Blood\nCompatibility Rules" as D2

Seeker --> P31 : patient's blood group,\ninclude compatible
D2 --> P31 : who can receive\nfrom whom
P31 --> P32 : donor blood groups
D1 --> P32 : matching donor records
P32 --> P33 : donors
Seeker --> P33 : city (optional)
P33 --> P34 : donors in the city
P34 --> P35 : available donors with\nenough days since last donation
P35 --> Seeker : suitable donors,\nbest matches first
@enduml
